description: Keep reusable helpers in src/lib instead of Astro frontmatter
globs: src/**/*.{ts,astro}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Shared helpers

- Put reusable logic in `src/lib/*.ts`. Keep `.astro` files as UI composers.
- Colocate Vitest coverage as `src/lib/<module>.test.ts`.
- For local images, use Astro `<Image>` and import widths/sizes/format from `src/lib/images.ts`. Add a named helper there instead of copying `thumbnailWidths`.

```ts
// ❌ BAD — helper trapped in a component
function thumbnailWidths(sourceWidth: number): number[] { /* ... */ }

// ✅ GOOD
import { CARD_THUMBNAIL_SIZES, thumbnailWidths } from '../../lib/images';
```
